  "torFailCensoredTitle": "Inaonekana Tor imezuiwa",
  "torFailCensoredBody": "Mtandao huu unajibu, lakini si kwa Tor: vipeperushi vinavyohitajika havifikiki. Madaraja hukwepa kizuizi cha aina hii; mtandao mwingine pia hufanya kazi.",
